  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/441f7f48-ddca-4b01-825b-caf398f023f6.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:4.29375in;height:1.63333in\" /></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> lie on the line<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math> Putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the maximum negative integer value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
